# Full Phase 3 demonstration with six events and resource reuse
EVENT Opening ON 2026-10-25 AT 09:00 TO 10:30;
EVENT Workshop ON 2026-10-25 AT 10:00 TO 12:00;
EVENT Lunch ON 2026-10-25 AT 12:00 TO 13:00;
EVENT Panel ON 2026-10-25 AT 13:00 TO 14:00;
EVENT Expo ON 2026-10-25 AT 14:00 TO 16:00;
EVENT Closing ON 2026-10-25 AT 16:00 TO 17:00;

RESERVE MainHall FOR Opening CAPACITY 200;
ASSIGN WelcomeScreen TO Opening;
IF capacity >= 150 THEN RESERVE LabA FOR Workshop CAPACITY 80;
IF capacity < 50 THEN ASSIGN BackupMic TO Workshop;
CANCEL Opening;

RESERVE MainHall FOR Workshop CAPACITY 100;
ASSIGN Projector TO Workshop;
RESERVE Cafeteria FOR Lunch CAPACITY 120;
ASSIGN Catering TO Lunch;
RESERVE MainHall FOR Panel CAPACITY 90;
IF capacity == 90 THEN ASSIGN Microphone TO Panel;
RESERVE ExpoCenter FOR Expo CAPACITY 300;
IF capacity != 300 THEN ASSIGN ExtraDisplay TO Expo;
RESERVE MainHall FOR Closing CAPACITY 200;
ASSIGN StageLights TO Closing;
